{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If you could use magic and lived in the late 16th century, how would you choose to live?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you cherished solitude but one day impulsively made a friend, would you try to protect her from charges of &quot;heresy&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mountain village, you can help the villagers with their requests\u2014or choose not to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make can come from your heart or mere whimsy. Your choices will shape your life and the life of your closest friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a wise woman living in the 16th century. To complete your graduation project, you settle temporarily in a remote mountain village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your neighbors with their daily struggles, and they will help you in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside your best friend to confront beasts and other creatures threatening the village. Uncover the secrets of magic through your journey, and perhaps even face your inner demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read and make choices to steer the story, experiencing up to four text-based battles and six possible endings\u2014along with local culinary specialties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how tough life gets, don\u2019t forget to enjoy a good meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art assets created with AI assistance. Sources:<br>MiaoMiao Pixel (by Orscat)<br>Illustrious Flanime XL - High-Quality Flat Anime (by Orscat)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816020?t=1773544692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816020?t=1773544692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816020/0546b89e93dc81e6d19ed379d095bd0dc249c5ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773544692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816020/0546b89e93dc81e6d19ed379d095bd0dc249c5ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773544692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"\u5305\u542b\u6740\u5bb3\u5bb6\u755c\uff0c\u72e9\u730e\u91ce\u751f\u52a8\u7269\uff0c\u7834\u574f\u91ce\u751f\u52a8\u7269\u5c38\u4f53\u7684\u884c\u4e3a\u3002\r\n\u5305\u542b\u7528\u9b54\u6cd5\uff0c\u5f13\u7bad\uff0c\u8fd1\u6218\u6b66\u5668\u6740\u6b7b\u4eba\u7c7b\u654c\u4eba\u7684\u884c\u4e3a\u3002\r\n\u5305\u542b\u9002\u5ea6\u7684\u88f8\u9732\u548c\u8eab\u4f53\u63a5\u89e6\uff0c\u4f46\u65e0\u660e\u786e\u7684\u8272\u60c5\u5185\u5bb9\u3002"},"demos":[{"appid":4031040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Common problem</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter an issue where the game screen exceeds the screen boundaries and cannot be fully displayed after launching the game, or if the screen goes black when switching between fullscreen and windowed mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > this is commonly seen on devices with smaller screens \u2014 the problem is often caused by Windows scaling settings. You can resolve it using the following method:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. On the library page of the game, click [Manage] -&gt; [Browse Local Files].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816020/extras/706bfed49996343de2ed08b13aef8915.avif?t=1773544692\" width=944 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Right-click on &quot;game.exe&quot; and select [Properties].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816020/extras/123d6deff58bc98fdcd3ef6ab293dbf9.avif?t=1773544692\" width=422 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. In the Properties window, navigate to [Compatibility] -&gt; [Change high DPI settings]. Check the box for [Override high DPI scaling behavior] and set the scaling to be performed by [Application].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816020/extras/27502d8fa427f772ff0bcaea1f05d8df.avif?t=1773544692\" width=418 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Click OK to close the Properties window, then try launching the game again.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If you could use magic and lived in the late 16th century, how would you choose to live?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you cherished solitude but one day impulsively made a friend, would you try to protect her from charges of &quot;heresy&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mountain village, you can help the villagers with their requests\u2014or choose not to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make can come from your heart or mere whimsy. Your choices will shape your life and the life of your closest friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a wise woman living in the 16th century. To complete your graduation project, you settle temporarily in a remote mountain village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your neighbors with their daily struggles, and they will help you in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside your best friend to confront beasts and other creatures threatening the village. Uncover the secrets of magic through your journey, and perhaps even face your inner demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read and make choices to steer the story, experiencing up to four text-based battles and six possible endings\u2014along with local culinary specialties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter how tough life gets, don\u2019t forget to enjoy a good meal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art assets created with AI assistance. Sources:<br>MiaoMiao Pixel (by Orscat)<br>Illustrious Flanime XL - High-Quality Flat Anime (by Orscat)</p>","developers":["Orscat"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816020/0fb880996d8af95eb752131a923bcadeaf33b4b9/header.jpg?t=1773544692","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816020/966406164/309ee63dbf19ad3a2acae468c5b81dd08010e7f5/1760858497/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760865764","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816020/966406164/309ee63dbf19ad3a2acae468c5b81dd08010e7f5/1760858497/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760865764","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816020/966406164/309ee63dbf19ad3a2acae468c5b81dd08010e7f5/1760858497/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760865764","id":257219765,"name":"gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219765/3da292246b09f15fd494bce7968865561084fa2b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760865764"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816020/98900177/1e7dd3f4884c469655ca790854e563dcaf56295d/1759668587/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760865766","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816020/98900177/1e7dd3f4884c469655ca790854e563dcaf56295d/1759668587/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760865766","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3816020/98900177/1e7dd3f4884c469655ca790854e563dcaf56295d/1759668587/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760865766","id":257212554,"name":"The story ","thumbnail":"https://shared.aka